/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-28T22:30:23Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-28T22:30:23Z", "body": "@bansiesta Does `set_callback_executor` still work with the new Asio rework? If so, there is no issue.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4148931378/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4148976037", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2814#issuecomment-4148976037", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2814", "id": 4148976037, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s73TFml", "user": {"login": "bansiesta", "id": 10187973, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTg3OTcz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10187973?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta", "html_url": "https://github.com/bansiesta", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-28T23:05:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-28T23:05:19Z", "body": "Yes, `set_callback_executor` works exactly as before after #2810. The Asio rework didn't touch the callback dispatch path at all \u2014 all user-facing callbacks still go through `_user_callback_queue` / `_callback_executor`, fully independent of the io_context thread.\n\nSo for the common integration case \u2014 \"I have my own event loop and want MAVSDK callbacks delivered there\" \u2014 `set_callback_executor` is still the right tool and it works.\n\nThe original issue is about a more advanced case: sharing the actual `io_context` so that MAVSDK's I/O participates in an existing Asio application without spawning an extra thread. That's a valid future enhancement but it's not needed for basic event loop integration. Closing this for now; can reopen if the shared io_context use-case becomes a concrete requirement.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4148976037/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4148931378", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2814#issuecomment-4148931378", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2814", "id": 4148931378, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s73S6sy", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https: